  "description": "From flirts to mama’s boys to married men, intentionally Sun Choi keeps dating men like those. Promising to herself, not to date men like those ever again, she developed a game called ‘Dating Simulation.’ Since its release is just around the corner that she went to work even on the weekend and played the game as a developer. She plays a ‘share house version’ where you can meet various men of various classes all at once. However, she gets wakes up in the game as the female character.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/2D-%EB%82%A8%EC%B9%9C%EA%B3%BC-%EC%97%94%EB%94%A9%EC%9D%84-%EB%B3%B4%EB%8A%94-%EB%B2%95/2921), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60108596)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://manta.net/en/series/a-romantic-ending-with-my-2d-boyfriend?seriesId=2925), [S.Chinese](https://pdt.tencentac.com/?contentId=324), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/2dboyfriends/list?title_no=5247), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance/2dboyfriends/list?title_no=5288)",
